# Third-party notices — release gate

This repository is Apache-2.0. Runtime dependency versions are locked in
`backend/uv.lock` and `frontend/bun.lock`; final release notices must be
generated from those exact installed dependency trees, not from version ranges.

## Included project artifacts

| Component | License/provenance | Release state |
|---|---|---|
| Dörtgöz source code | Apache-2.0, repository `LICENSE` | Included |
| `motion-baseline-v1` JSON configuration | Team-authored, MIT declaration in `models/MANIFEST.json` | Included with SHA-256 |
| VLM weights | Not included | Must have an Apache-2.0/MIT local manifest and SHA-256 |
| FFmpeg/ffprobe executable | Not included | Current developer GPL-enabled build is expressly excluded |

## Finalization blockers

This file is intentionally not a completed SBOM or legal clearance. Before an
external release, generate notices from a fresh frozen Python/Bun installation,
record the exact base-image digest and its notices, run the AGPL denylist scan,
and resolve the FFmpeg/UCA license items in
ekip içi lisans kayıt defteri. Until then, no offline bundle may be
labelled as a redistributable final release.
